title:  Live DFA a1 data field (aerobic threshold from heart rate variability) and its entry in the field menus, needs P8
desc:   Field ID 12 shows DFA a1 over the last 2 minutes of beats (about 0.75 at the aerobic threshold), also saved in the ride file as the "Alpha1" developer field (Intervals.icu DFA a1 chart); pick it on the unit as the last item of the Heart Rate category (ride screen long press, or Settings > data fields)
source: patches/P9-live-dfa-a1.c, patches/P9-field-menu.c, docs/how-it-works.md
